=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2192 same story, same ending</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uded1 No interaction beyond advancing text</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Think of it as an <strong>interactive memorial essay</strong>\u2014</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>about memory, structural violence, and quiet faith.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898600/extras/a55572cffaf4b7dd827d81fadc09ddce.avif?t=1765087049\" width=800 height=3 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Tags &amp; Themes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mental health</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suicide and grief</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Childhood trauma</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depression as memory disorder</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prosopagnosia</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emotional Scars</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catholic faith and spiritual guilt</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Artistic ambition vs. social reality</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regional disparity &amp; social isolation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real estate bubble</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Educational corruption</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Office politics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Structural violence</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cults</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898600/extras/a55572cffaf4b7dd827d81fadc09ddce.avif?t=1765087049\" width=800 height=3 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udde8\ufe0f <strong>Who This Is For</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Readers of memoirs and personal essays</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans of text-driven visual novels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyone curious about what \u201cmeritocracy\u201d looks like under collapse</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those seeking <strong>a solemn