7049","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898600/63f7ab1d656ddd0803b7df53134d5b8c71b1be03/ss_63f7ab1d656ddd0803b7df53134d5b8c71b1be03.600x338.jpg?t=1765087049"}],"short_description":"For 20 years, she lived with depression. Now, she's strong enough to name what happened: a social murder. This is a visual essay\u2014not a game\u2014with over 400 illustrations about grief, guilt, and survival in a collapsing meritocracy.","steam_appid":3898600,"support_info":{"email":"seoulhitchhikerstudio@gmail.com","url":"https://seoulhitchhikerstudio.github.io/"},"supported_languages":"English, Korean","type":"game","website":"https://seoulhitchhikerstudio.github.io/"}